"frames. This is only useful if frames overlap each other. If multiple frames "
"are selected they are all raised in turn."
msgstr ""
"Codi'r ffrâm a ddewisir yn gyfredol er mwyn iddi ymddangos uwchben pob "
"ffrâm arall.  Nid yw hyn yn ddefnyddiol ond os mae'r fframiau yn "
"gorgyffwrdd eu gilydd.  Os dewisir fframiau lluosol, cânt eu codi i gyd yn "
"eu tro."

#: kwview.cc:467
msgid "&Lower Frame"
msgstr "&Iselhau Ffrâm"

#: kwview.cc:470
msgid ""
"Lower the currently selected frame so that it disappears under any frame "
"that overlaps it"
msgstr ""
"Iselhau'r ffrâm a ddewisir yn gyfredol er mwyn iddi ddiflannu dan unrhyw "
"ffrâm sy'n gorgyffwrdd â hi"

#: kwview.cc:471
msgid ""
"Lower the currently selected frame so that it disappears under any frame "
"that overlaps it. If multiple frames are selected they are all lowered in "
"turn."
msgstr ""
"Iselhau'r ffrâm a ddewisir yn gyfredol er mwyn iddi ddiflannu dan unrhyw "
"ffrâm sy'n gorgyffwrdd â hi.  Os dewisir fframiau lluosol, cânt eu codi i "
"gyd yn eu tro."

#: kwview.cc:473 kwview.cc:2378
msgid "Bring to Front"
msgstr "Anfon i'r Blaen"

#: kwview.cc:477 kwview.cc:2382
msgid "Send to Back"
msgstr "Anfon i'r Cefn"

#: kwview.cc:483
msgid "Text Mode"
msgstr "Modd Testun"

#: kwview.cc:486
msgid "Only show the text of the document."
msgstr "Dangos testun y ddogfen yn unig."

#: kwview.cc:487
msgid ""
"Do not show any pictures, formatting or layout. KWord will display only the "
"text for editing."
msgstr ""
"Peidiwch â dangos unrhyw lun, fformatio, neu haenlun.  Bydd KWord yn dangos "
"y testun yn unig ar gyfer golygu."

#: kwview.cc:490
msgid "&Page Mode"
msgstr "&Modd Tudalen"

#: kwview.cc:493
msgid ""
"Switch to page mode."
"<br>"
"<br> Page mode is designed to make editing your text easy."
"<br>"
"<br>This function is most frequently used to return to text editing after "
"switching to preview mode."
msgstr ""
"Newid i fodd tudalen. "
"<br> "
"<br>Bwriad modd tudalen yw gwneud golygu eich testun yn haws.  "
"<br>Defnyddir y sywddogaeth yma gan amlaf i ddychwelyd i olygu testun ar "
"ôl newid i fodd rhagolwg."

#: kwview.cc:494
msgid "Switch to page editing mode."
msgstr "Newid i fodd golygu tudalen."

#: kwview.cc:498
msgid "Pre&view Mode"
msgstr "Modd Rhagol&wg"

#: kwview.cc:501
msgid ""
"Zoom out from your document to get a look at several pages of your "
"document.<br><br>The number of pages per line can be customized."
msgstr ""
"Pellhau o'ch dogfen i gael trosolwg ar mwy nag un dudalen yn eich dogfen.  "
"<br><br>Gellir addasu y nifer o dudalennau ar bob llinell."

#: kwview.cc:502
msgid "Zoom out to a multiple page view."
msgstr "Pellhau i weld tudalennau lluosol."

#: kwview.cc:506
msgid "&Formatting Characters"
msgstr "Noda&u Fformatio"

#: kwview.cc:509
msgid "Toggle the display of non-printing characters."
msgstr "Dangos/cuddio nodau di-argraffu."

#: kwview.cc:510
msgid ""
"Toggle the display of non-printing characters."
"<br>"
"<br>"
"When this is enabled, KWord shows you tabs, spaces, carriage returns and "
"other non-printing characters."
msgstr ""
"Dangos/cuddio nodau di-argraffu. "
"<br> "
"<br> "
"Os yn alluog, mae KWord yn dangos i chi "
"tabnodau, gofodnodau, dychwelnodau, a nodau eraill di-argraffu."

#: kwview.cc:512
msgid "Frame &Borders"
msgstr "Borderi &Ffrâm"

#: kwview.cc:515
msgid "Turns the border display on and off."
msgstr "Dangos/cuddio borderi."

#: kwview.cc:516
msgid ""
"Turns the border display on and off."
"<br>"
"<br>The borders are never printed. This option is useful to see how the "
"document will appear on the printed page."
msgstr ""
"Dangos/cuddio ffiniau. "
"<br> "
"<br> Ni argraffir y ffiniau byth.  Mae'r dewisiad yma o ddefnydd wrth "
"weld sut bydd y ddogfen yn ymddangos ar y dudalen wedi'i hargraffu."

#: kwview.cc:518
msgid "Show &Header"
msgstr "Dangos &Pennawd"

#: kwview.cc:521
msgid "Shows and hides header display."
msgstr "Dangos/cuddio pennawd."

#: kwview.cc:522
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of headers in "
"KWord."
"<br>"
"<br>Headers are special frames at the top of each page which can contain "
"page numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y dewisiad yma yn dangos neu guddio penawdau yn KWord.  "
"<br> "
"<br>Fframiau arbennig wrth ben pob tudalen yw penawdau, a all gynnwys rhifau tudalen neu "
"wybodaeth arall."

#: kwview.cc:524
msgid "Show Foo&ter"
msgstr "Dangos &Troedyn"

#: kwview.cc:527
msgid "Shows and hides footer display."
msgstr "Dangos/cuddio troedyn."

#: kwview.cc:528
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of footers in KWord. "
"<br>"
"<br>Footers are special frames at the bottom of each page which can contain "
"page numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y dewisiad yma yn dangos neu guddio troedynnau yn KWord.  "
"<br> "
"<br>Fframiau arbennig wrth waelod pob tudalen yw troedynnau, a all gynnwys rhifau tudalen "
"neu wybodaeth arall."

#: kwview.cc:539
msgid "Sp&ecial Character..."
msgstr "Nod A&rbennig..."

#: kwview.cc:543 kwview.cc:544
msgid "Insert one or more symbols or letters not found on the keyboard."
msgstr "Mewnosod un neu fwy o symbolau neu lythrennau ni chanfyddir ar y bysellfwrdd."

#: kwview.cc:550
msgid "Page Break"
msgstr "Toriad Tudalen"

#: kwview.cc:551
msgid "Force the remainder of the text into the next page."
msgstr "Gorfodi gweddill y testun i mewn i'r dudalen nesaf."

#: kwview.cc:552
msgid ""
"This inserts a non-printing character at the current cursor position. All "
"text after this point will be moved into the next page."
msgstr ""
"Mae hyn yn mewnosod nod di-argraffu wrth leoliad cyfredol y cyrchydd.  Bydd "
"pob testun ar ôl y pwynt yma yn cael ei symud i mewn i'r dudalen nesaf."

#: kwview.cc:554
msgid "&Hard Frame Break"
msgstr "Toriad Ffrâ&m Caled"

#: kwview.cc:555
msgid "Force the remainder of the text into the next frame."
msgstr "Gorfodi gweddill y testun i mewn i'r ffrâm nesaf."

#: kwview.cc:556
msgid ""
"This inserts a non-printing character at the current cursor position. All "
"text after this point will be moved into the next frame in the frameset."
msgstr ""
"Mae hyn yn mewnosod nod di-argraffu wrth leoliad cyfredol y cyrchydd.  Bydd "
"pob testun ar ôl y pwynt yma yn cael ei symud i mewn i'r ffrâm nesaf yn y set fframiau."

#: kwview.cc:559
msgid "Page..."
msgstr "Tudalen..."

#: kwview.cc:563
msgid "Link..."
msgstr "Cyswllt..."

#: kwview.cc:566 kwview.cc:567
msgid "Insert a Web address, email address or hyperlink to a file."
msgstr "Mewnosod cyfeiriad gwe, cyfeiriad ebost, neu hypergyswllt i ffeil."

#: kwview.cc:569
msgid "Comment..."
msgstr "Sylwad..."

#: kwview.cc:572
msgid "Insert a comment about the selected text."
msgstr "Mewnosod sylwad am y testun detholedig."

#: kwview.cc:573
msgid ""
"Insert a comment about the selected text. These comments are not designed to "
"appear on the final page."
msgstr ""
"Mewnosod sylwad am y testun detholedig.  Ni arddangosir y sylwadau yma ar y "
"dudalen derfynol."

#: kwview.cc:575
msgid "Edit Comment..."
msgstr "Golygu Sylwad..."

#: kwview.cc:578 kwview.cc:579
msgid "Change the content of a comment."
msgstr "Newid cynnwys sylwad."

#: kwview.cc:581
msgid "Remove Comment"
msgstr "Gwaredu Sylwad"

#: kwview.cc:584 kwview.cc:585
msgid "Remove the selected document comment."
msgstr "Gwaredu'r sylwad penodol o'r ddogfen."

#: kwview.cc:586
msgid "Copy Text of Comment..."
msgstr "Copïo Testun sylwad..."

#: kwview.cc:591
msgid "&Footnote/Endnote..."
msgstr "&Troednodyn/Diweddnodyn..."

#: kwview.cc:594 kwview.cc:595
msgid "Insert a footnote referencing the selected text."
msgstr "Mewnosod troednodyn sy'n cyfeirio at y testun detholedig."

#: kwview.cc:597 kwview.cc:3300
msgid "Table of &Contents"
msgstr "Tabl &Cynnwys"

#: kwview.cc:600 kwview.cc:601
msgid "Insert table of contents at the current cursor position."
msgstr "Mewnosod tabl cynnwys wrth leoliad cyfredol y cyrchydd."

#: kwview.cc:604
msgid "&Variable"
msgstr "&Newidyn"

#: kwview.cc:608
msgid "Document &Information"
msgstr "Gwybodaeth Ddo&gfen"

#: kwview.cc:609
msgid "&Date"
msgstr "&Dyddiad"

#: kwview.cc:610
msgid "&Time"
msgstr "&Amser"

#: kwview.cc:611
msgid "&Page"
msgstr "&Tudalen"

#: kwview.cc:613 kwview.cc:1383
msgid "&Custom"
msgstr "&Addasiedig"

#: kwview.cc:622
msgid "&Refresh All Variables"
msgstr "C&yfredoli Pob Newidyn"

#: kwview.cc:625
msgid "Update all variables to current values."
msgstr "Diweddaru pob newidyn i'r gwerthoedd cyfredol."

#: kwview.cc:626
msgid ""
"Update all variables in the document to current values."
"<br>"
"<br>This will update page numbers, dates or any other variables that need "
"updating."
msgstr ""
"Diweddaru pob newidyn yn y ddogfen i'r gwerthoedd cyfredol. "
"<br> "
"<br>Bydd hyn yn diweddaru rhifau tudalen, dyddiadau, neu unrhyw newidyn arall sydd angen ei "
"ddiweddaru."

#: kwview.cc:630
msgid "&Expression"
msgstr "&Mynegiad"

#: kwview.cc:634
msgid "Te&xt Frame"
msgstr "Ffrâm &Testun"

#: kwview.cc:637 kwview.cc:638
msgid "Create a new text frame."
msgstr "Creu ffrâm testun newydd."

#: kwview.cc:641
msgid "For&mula"
msgstr "Ffo&rmiwla"

#: kwview.cc:644 kwview.cc:645
msgid "Insert a formula into a new frame."
msgstr "Mewnosod fformiwla mewn ffrâm newydd."

#: kwview.cc:647
msgid "&Table..."
msgstr "&Tabl..."

#: kwview.cc:651
msgid "Create a table."
msgstr "Creu tabl"

#: kwview.cc:652
msgid ""
"Create a table."
"<br><br>The table can either exist in a frame of its own or inline."
msgstr ""
"Creu tabl.  "
"<br><br>Gall y tabl fodoli unai mewn ffrâm ei hun neu fewnlein."

#: kwview.cc:654
msgid "P&icture..."
msgstr "Ll&un..."

#: kwview.cc:658
msgid "Create a new frame for a picture."
msgstr "Creu ffâm newydd ar gyfer llun."

#: kwview.cc:659
msgid "Create a new frame for a picture or diagram."
msgstr "Creu ffâm newydd ar gyfer llun neu ddiagram."

#: kwview.cc:662
msgid "&Object Frame"
msgstr "Ffrâm &Wrthrych"

#: kwview.cc:665 kwview.cc:666
msgid "Insert an object into a new frame."
msgstr "Mewnosod gwrthrych i mewn i ffrâm newydd."

#: kwview.cc:668
msgid "Fi&le..."
msgstr "Ff&eil..."

#: kwview.cc:674
msgid "&Font..."
msgstr "W&ynebfath..."

#: kwview.cc:677
msgid "Change character size, font, boldface, italics, etc."
msgstr "Newid maint y nodau, wynebfath, trwm, italig, ayyb."

#: kwview.cc:678
msgid "Change the attributes of the currently selected characters."
msgstr "Newid priodoleddau'r nodau a ddewisir yn gyfredol."

#: kwview.cc:680
msgid "&Paragraph..."
msgstr "&Paragraff..."

#: kwview.cc:683
msgid "Change paragraph margins, text flow, borders, bullets, numbering, etc."
msgstr "Newid ymylon paragraff, llif testun, ffiniau, bwledi, rhifo, ayyb."

#: kwview.cc:684
msgid ""
"Change paragraph margins, text flow, borders, bullets, numbering, "
"etc."
"<p>Select text in multiple paragraphs to change the formatting of all "
"selected paragraphs."
"<p>"
"If no text is selected, the paragraph where the cursor is located will be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Newid ymylon paragraff, llif testun, ffiniau, bwledi, rhifo, ayyb. "
"<p> Dewiswch destun mewn paragraffau lluosol i newid fformatio pob paragraff a ddewisir. "
"<p> Os ni ddewisir testun, newidir y paragraff lle lleolir y cyrchydd."

#: kwview.cc:686
msgid "F&rame/Frameset Properties..."
msgstr "Priodweddau Ff&râm/Set Fframiau..."

#: kwview.cc:689
msgid "Alter frameset properties."
msgstr "Addasu priodweddau set fframiau."

#: kwview.cc:690
msgid "Alter frameset properties.<p>Currently you can change the frame background."
msgstr ""
"Addasu priodweddau set fframiau."
"<p>Yn gyfredol, gallwch newid cefndir y ffrâm."

#: kwview.cc:692
msgid "Page &Layout..."
msgstr "Haenlun Tu&dalen..."

#: kwview.cc:695
msgid "Change properties of entire page."
msgstr "Newid priodweddau tudalen gyfan."

#: kwview.cc:696
msgid ""
"Change properties of the entire page."
"<p>"
"Currently you can change paper size, paper orientation, header and footer "
"sizes, and column settings."
msgstr ""
"Newid priodweddau'r dudalen gyfan."
"<p>Yn gyfredol, gallwch newid maint papur, cyfeiriadaeth y papur, maint y "
"pennawd a'r troedyn, a gosodiadau colofn."

#: kwview.cc:699
msgid "&Frame Style Manager"
msgstr "Rheolydd &Arddull Ffrâm"

#: kwview.cc:702
msgid "Change attributes of framestyles."
msgstr "Newid priodoleddau arddulliau fframiau."

#: kwview.cc:703
msgid ""
"Change background and borders of framestyles."
"<p>Multiple framestyles can be changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Newid cefndir a ffiniau arddulliau fframiau."
"<p>Gellir newid mwy nag un arddull ffrâm gan ddefnyddio'r blwch ymgom."

#: kwview.cc:706
msgid "&Style Manager"
msgstr "Rheolyd ardd&ull"

#: kwview.cc:709
msgid "Change attributes of styles."
msgstr "Newid priodoleddau arddulliau."

#: kwview.cc:710
msgid ""
"Change font and paragraph attributes of styles."
"<p>Multiple styles can be changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Newid priodoleddau wynebfath a pharagraff mewn arddull."
"<p>Gellir newid mwy nag un arddull gan ddefnyddio'r blwch ymgom."

#: kwview.cc:717
msgid "Increase Font Size"
msgstr "Cynyddu Maint y Wynebfath"

#: kwview.cc:718
msgid "Decrease Font Size"
msgstr "Lleihau Maint y Wynebfath"

#: kwview.cc:720
msgid "Font Family"
msgstr "Teulu Wynebfath"

#: kwview.cc:725 kwview.cc:727
msgid "St&yle"
msgstr "Ardd&ull"

